# ALLOWLIST. This working directory will hold things that must never be
# published: the ROM input, ROM-extracted/derived game data, rendered frame
# dumps, recordings, build output and reference clones (refs/).
# Only source, scripts and docs are tracked -- everything else is ignored by
# the leading "*" and has to be re-included explicitly below.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!README_MIYOO.md
!dev.sh
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile.miyoo
!tools/
!tools/*.py
!tools/*.sh
!tools/*.txt
!tools/*.json
# The Miyoo Mini release (tools/build_miyoo.sh): the packer and its launch templates (the shared
# miyoo/), the game's game.json and its icon (miyoo/icon.png, drawn as miyoo/icon.svg); the developer-only bench Apps entry (miyoo/bench, not in the zip).
!miyoo/
!miyoo/game.json
!miyoo/icon.svg
!miyoo/templates/
!miyoo/templates/*
!miyoo/tools/
!miyoo/tools/*.py
!miyoo/bench/
!miyoo/bench/launch.sh
!miyoo/bench/config.json
# The port tree: n64decomp/007 @ c4356466 code (src/, include/) + our layer (hh/).
# port/assets = approved decomp metadata, copied by tools/port_assets.sh, never tracked.
!port/
!port/**
port/assets/
port/build/
port/**/*.o
port/**/*.log
port/ge_save/
# Never tracked anywhere (last, so they also win inside port/): ROMs, builds, dumps.
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.mp4
*.log
*.core
core
core.*
*.ppm
*.png
# ...except the drawn launcher icon (ours, not from the ROM)
!/miyoo/icon.png
*.wav
*.bin
.DS_Store
# the old release icon, cut from the player's ROM (tools/make_icon_game.py, unused since 2026-10-06): never in git
/miyoo/icon_game.png
# the Miyoo64 repository's docs
!SETTINGS.md
